graph LR
    Start([Task]) --> Generate

    Generate[GENERATE<br/>Create Initial Output]
    Generate --> Critique

    Critique[CRITIQUE<br/>Evaluate Quality]
    Critique --> Decision

    Decision{Meet Standards?}
    Decision -->|No| Revise
    Decision -->|Yes| Final([Final Output])

    Revise[REVISE<br/>Improve Based on Feedback]
    Revise --> Critique

    style Start fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff,stroke:#388E3C
    style Final fill:#2196F3,color:#fff,stroke:#1565C0
    style Generate fill:#FF9800,color:#fff,stroke:#E65100
    style Critique fill:#9C27B0,color:#fff,stroke:#6A1B9A
    style Decision fill:#F44336,color:#fff,stroke:#B71C1C
    style Revise fill:#00BCD4,color:#fff,stroke:#00838F
